{"availability":"available","full":"AFSlayer/antigravity-server","name":"antigravity-server","description":"Use the Antigravity desktop app from your phone. One binary that serves Antigravity's own web UI to your devices, behind a password.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Go","stars":28,"forks":4,"created":"2026-08-18T13:59:07Z","updated":"2026-10-06T12:02:42Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://afslayer.github.io/antigravity-server/","topics":["ai-agents","antigravity","antigravity-ide","golang","google-antigravity","mobile","pwa","remote-development","reverse-proxy","self-hosted"],"demo":"https://afslayer.github.io/antigravity-server/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:15.994Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:15.994Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:15.994Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T05:44:15.994Z","stars":28,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A second front door to your own Antigravity — one that fixes the mobile web UI, keeps the UI off Google's relay, and runs unattended on a cheap Linux box.","One headless Linux box, two front doors, minutes apart.","Google now ships an official remote bridge at antigravity.google.com: sign in with the same account and you reach every machine of yours that is running Antigravity with remote access enabled. Reaching your own agent from a phone is no longer something this project has to provide — and a headless Linux server shows up in that list too."],"features":["Touch-Friendly Controls: Undo (↶) and Copy (📋) buttons remain permanently visible on mobile message bubbles.","Full Conversation Management: Delete conversations via the titlebar menu and toggle Pin/Archive directly from the history dropdown.","Precise Keyboard Tracking: Automatically collapses safe area insets to 0px and pins top navigation bar while adapting conversation height.","Smooth Scroll Anchoring & Top Guard: Prevents infinite history fetch storms and anchors scroll position when scrolling up to read earlier messages in long conversations.","Checks Google's official release buckets daily for new languageserver versions."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"72edd17d148b0117e4cbc64a6cd52e1388feaf913fb3f5bcfa8a6da586a80f54","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:16.149Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:16.149Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A second front door to your own Antigravity — one that fixes the mobile web UI, keeps the UI off Google's relay, and runs unattended on a cheap Linux box.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Google now ships an official remote bridge at antigravity.google.com: sign in with the same account and you reach every machine of yours that is running Antigravity with remote access enabled.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Direct Web Login: Open the Web UI, navigate to Settings, and complete Google authentication directly in your browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"72edd17d148b0117e4cbc64a6cd52e1388feaf913fb3f5bcfa8a6da586a80f54","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:16.149Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T12:02:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AFSlayer/antigravity-server/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T05:44:16.150Z","hash":"72edd17d148b0117e4cbc64a6cd52e1388feaf913fb3f5bcfa8a6da586a80f54","originalBytes":19724,"storedBytes":19724,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["server","agy-server","proxy","antigravity","connection","google","official","web","conversa